  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 2} \\frac{x f(2)-2 f(x)}{x-2}\\left(\\frac{0}{0}\\right)=\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 2} f(2)-2 f^{\\prime}(x)=f(2)-2 f^{\\prime}(2)=4-2 \\times 4=-4$",
    "image": null
  },
